65-
66:## Use case 1: share prefix KV between different vLLM instance through LMCache
67:The following instructions help deploy LMCache backend + multile vLLM instance by docker containers. The architecture of the demo application looks like this:
68-
69:<img width="817" alt="image" src="https://github.com/LMCache/LMCache/assets/25103655/ab64f84d-26e1-46ce-a503-e7e917b618bc">
70-
71-
72-**Prerequisites**: To run the quickstart demo, your server must have 2 GPUs and the [docker environment](https://docs.docker.com/engine/install/) installed.
73-
74-
75-**Step 1:** Pull docker images
76-```bash
77:docker pull apostacyh/lmcache-server:0.1.0
78:docker pull apostacyh/vllm:lmcache-0.1.0
79-```
80-
81:**Step 2:** Start LMCache backend server 
82-```bash
83:docker run --name lmcache-server --network host -d apostacyh/lmcache-server:0.1.0 0.0.0.0 65432
84-```
85-
86:**Step 3:** start 2 vLLM instances
87-```bash
88:# The first vLLM instance listens at port 8000
89-model=mistralai/Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.2    # Replace with your model name
90-sudo docker run --runtime nvidia --gpus '"device=0"' \
91:    -v <Huggingface cache dir on your local machine>:/root/.cache/huggingface \
92-    -p 8000:8000 \
93-    --env "HF_TOKEN=<Your huggingface token>" \
94-    --ipc=host \
95-    --network=host \
96:    apostacyh/vllm:lmcache-0.1.0 \
97-    --model $model --gpu-memory-utilization 0.7 --port 8000 \
98:    --lmcache-config-file /lmcache/LMCache/examples/example.yaml
99-```
100-
101:Now, open another terminal and start another vLLM instance
102-```bash
103:# The second vLLM instance listens at port 8001
104-model=mistralai/Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.2    # Replace with your model name
105-sudo docker run --runtime nvidia --gpus '"device=1"' \
106:    -v <Huggingface cache dir on your local machine>:/root/.cache/huggingface \
107-    -p 8001:8001 \
108-    --env "HF_TOKEN=<Your huggingface token>" \
109-    --ipc=host \
110-    --network=host \
111:    apostacyh/vllm:lmcache-0.1.0 \
112-    --model $model --gpu-memory-utilization 0.7 --port 8001 \
113:    --lmcache-config-file /lmcache/LMCache/examples/example.yaml
114-```
115-
116:Remember to replace the `Huggingface cache dir on your local machine` and `Your huggingface token` in the commandline.
117-
118:The vLLM engines are ready after you see the logs like this:
119-```
120-INFO:     Started server process [865615]
121-INFO:     Waiting for application startup.
122-INFO:     Application startup complete.
123-INFO:     Uvicorn running on http://0.0.0.0:8000 (Press CTRL+C to quit)
124-```

